@startuml
title 最后一席并发时间线
participant RequestA
participant RequestB
database PostgreSQL
RequestA -> PostgreSQL : BEGIN; SELECT class FOR UPDATE
activate PostgreSQL
RequestB -> PostgreSQL : BEGIN; SELECT class FOR UPDATE
note right of RequestB : 等待同一教学班行锁
RequestA -> PostgreSQL : count=0; INSERT; COMMIT
deactivate PostgreSQL
activate PostgreSQL
PostgreSQL --> RequestB : 获得行锁
RequestB -> PostgreSQL : count=1，容量=1
RequestB -> PostgreSQL : ROLLBACK
deactivate PostgreSQL
@enduml
